Package: roam
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Roam maintainers <ossacolsale@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libadwaita-1-0, libgtk-4-1, network-manager, systemd, util-linux
Description: Local Wi-Fi roaming assistant
 Roam monitors Wi-Fi signal and can switch between selected saved
 NetworkManager profiles when the current connection becomes weak or unstable.
